Maintainer: Satyaprakash Nayak <satyaprakash.nayak@gmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/sn248/sundialr, https://sn248.github.io/sundialr/
BugReports: https://github.com/sn248/sundialr/issues
Description: Provides a way to call the functions in the 'SUNDIALS' C ODE solving library (<https://computing.llnl.gov/projects/sundials>). Currently the serial versions of the ODE solver 'CVODE', the sensitivity calculator 'CVODES' and the differential algebraic equation solver 'IDA' from the 'SUNDIALS' library are implemented, together with a wrapper around 'CVODE' for systems with discontinuities such as repeated doses. The ODE is written as an 'R' or 'Rcpp' function, and the 'SUNDIALS' library does not need to be installed on the local machine. A C-level interface to 'CVODE' and 'ARKODE' is also registered for use from the compiled code of other packages.
